\end_inset

.
 Experimental irradiations have been performed at 
\begin_inset Formula $0.1$
\end_inset

 
\begin_inset Formula $J/cm^{2}$
\end_inset

, which demonstrate the possible number of free-carriers in Si surface in
 air environment is 
\begin_inset Formula $2.0\times10^{21}$
\end_inset


\begin_inset Formula $cm^{-3}$
\end_inset

, and is 
\begin_inset Formula $2.5\times10^{21}$
\end_inset


\begin_inset Formula $cm^{-3}$
\end_inset

